msgid "以太之光"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41008_TextLabel"
msgid "杂学"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41009_TextBody"
msgid "现在使用的以太之光多数是经萨雷安民众之手制造出来的。不过发明以太之光的人并不是他们，他们只是将远古时代的创造物重现了出来而已。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41009_TextTitle"
msgid "以太之光"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41009_TextLabel"
msgid "杂学"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41010_TextBody"
msgid ""
"萨雷安魔法大学在解析停止运转的亚拉戈式以太之光的遗物之后，获得了传送技术。然而，近几年有消息称，某个冒险者在魔大陆阿济兹拉发现了运转状态下的亚拉戈式以太之光。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41010_TextTitle"
msgid "以太之光"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41010_TextLabel"
msgid "杂学"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41011_TextBody"
msgid "捕鱼人行会的发展和地理条件密切相关。利姆萨·罗敏萨这个地方海产资源丰富，渔业也就理所当然地兴盛起来。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41011_TextTitle"
msgid "捕鱼人"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41011_TextLabel"
msgid "杂学"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41012_TextBody"
msgid "众所周知，捕鱼人行会“网仓”是利姆萨·罗敏萨最大的渔业组织。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41012_TextTitle"
msgid "捕鱼人"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41012_TextLabel"
msgid "杂学"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41013_TextBody"
msgid "捕鱼人行会拥有艾欧泽亚最大型的鱼塘。总是能捕到大量鲜鱼。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41013_TextTitle"
msgid "捕鱼人"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41013_TextLabel"
msgid "杂学"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41014_TextBody"
msgid "对了，长时间在同一个地方钓鱼的话，鱼会有所警戒，之后就很难钓到了。要适时换地方哦。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41014_TextTitle"
msgid "捕鱼人"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41014_TextLabel"
msgid "杂学"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41015_TextBody"
msgid "适合钓该种鱼的道具、相应的技术水平，以及适合在钓场内穿着的方便钓鱼的装束……这些东西缺一不可，否则钓不到大猎物。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41015_TextTitle"
msgid "捕鱼人"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41015_TextLabel"
msgid "杂学"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41016_TextBody"
msgid ""
"利用强壮的脚在大地上奔跑的陆生大型鸟。在艾欧泽亚，陆行鸟自古就用来驮物、拉车以及骑乘。已知库尔札斯是陆行鸟的一大产地，除此之外，在阿巴拉提亚山脉的秘境“陆行鸟之森”里也有着大量野生的陆行鸟。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41016_TextTitle"
msgid "陆行鸟"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41016_TextLabel"
msgid "杂学"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41017_TextBody"
msgid "人是铁饭是钢，这个道理对陆行鸟来说也是一样的。饲料不同，专属陆行鸟受到的影响也各不相同。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41017_TextTitle"
msgid "陆行鸟"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41017_TextLabel"
msgid "杂学"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41018_TextBody"
msgid "在过去，一提到陆行鸟的繁殖，大家就会觉得那是北方邻邦——宗教城市伊修加德的专利。不过现在，格里达尼亚也渐渐在这方面取得成功。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41018_TextTitle"
msgid "陆行鸟"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41018_TextLabel"
msgid "杂学"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41019_TextBody"
msgid ""
"由“莫古力礼峰”经营的牧场，致力于让陆行鸟能够安定地进行繁殖，为此还专门从该项手艺的发源地伊修加德招来了饲养员。印有莫古力图案的气球是这里最显著的标志。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41019_TextTitle"
msgid "弯枝牧场"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41019_TextLabel"
msgid "杂学"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41020_TextBody"
msgid "陆行鸟是既敏感又聪明的生物。只要你一心一意地照顾它们，它们也会友好地回应。绝对不会做什么忘恩负义的事出来。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41020_TextTitle"
msgid "陆行鸟"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41020_TextLabel"
msgid "杂学"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41021_TextBody"
msgid "你知道吗？要想读懂风向，就需要追寻风脉。好了，你就好好读懂风向，让你的陆行鸟在天空中展翅飞翔吧！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41021_TextTitle"
msgid "风脉泉"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41021_TextLabel"
msgid "杂学"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41022_TextBody"
msgid "通过与各区域的风以太流“风脉泉”进行共鸣，可以获得在该区域飞行的能力。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41022_TextTitle"
msgid "风脉泉"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41022_TextLabel"
msgid "杂学"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41023_TextBody"
msgid "接触风脉泉，理解了附近的风以太流！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,41023_TextTitle"
msgid "风脉泉"
msgstr ""

