msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32196_TextBody"
msgid ""
"住在黑衣森林深处的幽谷之民，是一种非常小的兽人。外表非常可爱，像是裹着树叶的人偶。他们之中虽然幻术高手有很多，可是却经常会用幻术做一些非常过分的恶作剧，闹得鸡飞狗跳。如果旅行途中经过他们的栖息地，可一定要多加留意周围的一切可疑事物。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32196_TextTitle"
msgid "坏妖精"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32196_TextLabel"
msgid "兽人"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32197_TextBody"
msgid "在骷髅谷安营扎寨的哥布林雇来了一名愚钝粗暴的保镖，看上去是准备对附近的农场发起进攻。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32197_TextTitle"
msgid "崔普提克斯"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32197_TextLabel"
msgid "兽人"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32198_TextBody"
msgid "原本生活在黑金湖的哥布林族现在流窜到了骷髅谷，并且有在进行违法掠夺品交易的嫌疑。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32198_TextTitle"
msgid "哥布林商人"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32198_TextLabel"
msgid "兽人"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32199_TextBody"
msgid ""
"非常好战的山岳之民，生活在暴风肆虐的大溪谷。残留在他们手臂上的羽翼是曾在空中翱翔过的证明，也是他们的骄傲。他们希望夺回曾经居住过的黑衣森林，将林木献给他们信仰的风神。因此与格里达尼亚之间的关系非常不好。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32199_TextTitle"
msgid "鸟人族"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32199_TextLabel"
msgid "兽人"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32200_TextBody"
msgid "神勇队发现有鸟人族采伐部队正在入侵黑衣森林，这群被元灵放逐的蛮族至今仍在觊觎森林的宝贵财富。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32200_TextTitle"
msgid "鸟人族"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32200_TextLabel"
msgid "兽人"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32201_TextBody"
msgid "鸟人族又开始准备扩建殖民地了。他们已经将风扬殖民地附近的树木清理一空，这对森林的生态造成了极大的破坏。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32201_TextTitle"
msgid "鸟人族"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32201_TextLabel"
msgid "兽人"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32202_TextBody"
msgid "巨人族在萨纳兰出现了！这只徘徊的巨人对附近的行人有着很大的威胁，虽然我们不知道他从何处来，不过我们知道他即将往何处去——那就是七狱之下！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32202_TextTitle"
msgid "悲叹的布里阿柔斯"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32202_TextLabel"
msgid "兽人"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32203_TextBody"
msgid ""
"生活在帕戈尔赞草原的游牧之民，平日赶赶羊和蜥蜴，是乌尔达哈的宿敌。从小就接受各种军事训练，无论男女老幼，全都是优秀的兵士。另外，蜥蜴人擅长火法冶金技术，他们制作的武具也很有价值。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32203_TextTitle"
msgid "蜥蜴人族"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32203_TextLabel"
msgid "兽人"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32204_TextBody"
msgid "蜥蜴人军在每次执行军事行动之前都会让占卜师卜算当日的吉凶。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32204_TextTitle"
msgid "蜥蜴人族"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32204_TextLabel"
msgid "兽人"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32205_TextBody"
msgid "赞拉克祭场的占卜师“灰煤烟”佩古基·春能够预测出军事行动的吉凶，是一位非常棘手的咒术师。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32205_TextTitle"
msgid "灰煤烟佩古基·春"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32205_TextLabel"
msgid "兽人"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32206_TextBody"
msgid "咒言师马拉德·春又一次令恒辉队的官兵失去了自己的亲人，这名蜥蜴人暗杀者的手段极其残忍。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32206_TextTitle"
msgid "咒言师马拉德·春"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32206_TextLabel"
msgid "兽人"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32207_TextBody"
msgid "龟甲岛上的独眼巨人史特罗佩斯回来复仇了，甚至还带来了一个巨人族私人部队！他们现在正在四处惹是生非。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32207_TextTitle"
msgid "史特罗佩斯"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32207_TextLabel"
msgid "兽人"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32208_TextBody"
msgid "由于一群凶暴的骏鹰在四处活动，调查团的自然学家们无法进一步进行他们的调查，而且还经常出现人类被骏鹰捉走的情况。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32208_TextTitle"
msgid "骏鹰"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32208_TextLabel"
msgid "兽人"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32209_TextBody"
msgid "调查团的自然学家们又被难住了，这次是一个基迦巨人族的高僧在银泪湖北岸扰乱治安，自然学家们已经几个夜晚都没有睡过安稳觉了。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32209_TextTitle"
msgid "银发的狄俄涅"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32209_TextLabel"
msgid "兽人"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32210_TextBody"
msgid "黄衫队在埠头发现了偷渡者，不过他们当前的人手还无法保证成功捉拿阿科特修提姆。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32210_TextTitle"
msgid "偷渡者"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32210_TextLabel"
msgid "人物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32211_TextBody"
msgid "森林里有一个由护月之民构成的偷猎者团体，他们以“枯叶堆”为据点，并在森林中设置了很多捕兽夹。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32211_TextTitle"
msgid "偷猎者"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32211_TextLabel"
msgid "人物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32212_TextBody"
msgid "原沙蝎众之一的艾奥兰德·屈伊伯龙在灵灾中失去了她的生命，而她的一所别墅现在也已经变成了盗贼的据点，这群盗贼经常抢掠来往的商人。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32212_TextTitle"
msgid "屈伊伯龙家的人"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32212_TextLabel"
msgid "人物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32213_TextBody"
msgid ""
"灵灾造成的地壳变动令深埋在地下的消逝王都重见天日，可是却有很多前去调查的人再也没有归来。据传说那里存在一个巨汉的死灵会不断杀害调查者，并令他们成为死灵的一员。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32213_TextTitle"
msgid "送葬尸灵"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32213_TextLabel"
msgid "人物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32214_TextBody"
msgid "“骸旅团”是阿拉米格正规军的一部分残党，他们已经失去了当年的骄傲，沦落为靠抢劫偷盗为生的盗贼团。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32214_TextTitle"
msgid "骸旅团"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32214_TextLabel"
msgid "人物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32215_TextBody"
msgid "铜刃团准备捉拿成员均为原阿拉米格军的盗贼团体——“骸旅团”，其中一位名叫吉斯弗里德的人物力量非常强大。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32215_TextTitle"
msgid "破戒者吉斯弗里德"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32215_TextLabel"
msgid "人物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32216_TextBody"
msgid "骸旅团残党的首领，米露达已经很长时间没有了任何消息，不过现在她的藏身地终于暴露了。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32216_TextTitle"
msgid "奔走流转的米露达"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32216_TextLabel"
msgid "人物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32217_TextBody"
msgid "艾欧泽亚的羊毛产地有拉诺西亚地区和库尔札斯高地。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32217_TextTitle"
msgid "绵羊"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32217_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32218_TextBody"
msgid ""
"我们饲养的拉诺西亚绵羊，特征就是羊毛又白又软。\n"
"摸起来是不是很暖和啊？"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32218_TextTitle"
msgid "绵羊"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32218_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32219_TextBody"
msgid "不光栽培农作物，赤血雄鸡农场还在饲养绵羊和渡渡鸟。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32219_TextTitle"
msgid "绵羊"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32219_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32220_TextBody"
msgid ""
"大冰雪时代由高地之民驯化的羊。为了获取更多羊毛不断对其进行品种改良，最后变成了被棉花一样厚厚的羊毛包裹的状态。在拉诺西亚和库尔札斯还能看到野生的这种品种的羊羔。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32220_TextTitle"
msgid "绵羊"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32220_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32221_TextBody"
msgid ""
"第七灵灾后突然出现的类似植物的生物。具体是从哪里来的，至今未能解明。它们好像有着特殊的智能，可以不通过语言就相互进行交流，因还在研究途中，所以具体情况还不是很了解。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32221_TextTitle"
msgid "蔓德拉"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32221_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32222_TextBody"
msgid ""
"最近，这一带的鼹鼠大量繁殖，\n"
"把田地钻得坑坑洼洼的，实在很让人头疼。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32222_TextTitle"
msgid "鼹鼠"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32222_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32223_TextBody"
msgid ""
"我正撰写的《新艾欧泽亚博物志》……\n"
"其新一章的题目就是鼹鼠！\n"
"就是那种又矮又肥的鼹鼠，见过的吧！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32223_TextTitle"
msgid "鼹鼠"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32223_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32224_TextBody"
msgid ""
"鼹鼠是一种挖洞生活的生物，\n"
"可是却有一双巨大的眼睛。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32224_TextTitle"
msgid "鼹鼠"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32224_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32225_TextBody"
msgid ""
"为了筹备大角，我单凭一把手锯便前去挑战巨大的水牛，\n"
"一大意，就弄得遍体鳞伤了！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32225_TextTitle"
msgid "水牛"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32225_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32226_TextBody"
msgid "原牛是肉食用的动物野生化后的产物。既然本来是家畜，在驯养后不就可以用来搬运沉重的麦酒桶了么。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32226_TextTitle"
msgid "原牛"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32226_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32227_TextBody"
msgid "细长的沟鼠尾巴，适用于任何钓鱼场所的鱼饵，还被沙漠之民看作是男孩的护身符。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32227_TextTitle"
msgid "啮齿类"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32227_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32228_TextBody"
msgid "啃食农作物的小动物无疑是农夫们的天敌。请为我烹调出多汁味美的栗鼠肉排。用美食来解我平日的心头之恨。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32228_TextTitle"
msgid "啮齿类"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32228_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32229_TextBody"
msgid ""
"唔唔……好疼啊……\n"
"我去驱赶啃食围墙的松鼠，没想到被好几只围攻，\n"
"咬得我浑身都是伤……"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32229_TextTitle"
msgid "啮齿类"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32229_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32230_TextBody"
msgid "巨型陆蟹通常的寿命只有两到三年，然而六爪长老却从第五星历生存至今，古代的强者可不是那么轻易就屈服的！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32230_TextTitle"
msgid "陆蟹"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32230_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32231_TextBody"
msgid "巨型陆蟹一进入产卵期便会变得非常具有威胁性，令周边地区都不得安宁，为了解除这种威胁，一定要尽快削减产卵巨型陆蟹的数量。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32231_TextTitle"
msgid "陆蟹"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32231_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32232_TextBody"
msgid ""
"陆蟹在危急时便会逃跑，\n"
"一旦逃到特定地点，同伴就会随即出现。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32232_TextTitle"
msgid "陆蟹"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32232_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32233_TextBody"
msgid ""
"阴干晾晒的气球球皮被巨型陆蟹撕裂了，\n"
"我为此头疼得很。\n"
"那些家伙好像误把这东西当成猎物了。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32233_TextTitle"
msgid "陆蟹"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32233_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32234_TextBody"
msgid "黄道巨蟹巨大的蟹钳已经葬送了无数人的性命，甚至有人说蟹壳上会浮现牺牲者的死亡面容。这种危险性极高的魔物绝对不能放任不管！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32234_TextTitle"
msgid "陆蟹"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32234_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32235_TextBody"
msgid "一种名为利螯陆蟹的生物从海里登上了鲜血滨的沙滩，导致太阳海岸的居民无法安心在沙滩上散步了。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32235_TextTitle"
msgid "陆蟹"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32235_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32236_TextBody"
msgid "黄衫队现在被巨大的胡蜂闹得手忙脚乱，这只大家伙需要更多的人手去处理。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32236_TextTitle"
msgid "胡蜂"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32236_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32237_TextBody"
msgid "去利姆萨·罗敏萨购物后，在回来的路上被黑豺群狂追一路，真是不走运啊。可能是我手上的腌肉吸引了它们。"
msgstr ""

