msgid "黑豺"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32237_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32238_TextBody"
msgid "名字里虽然有“毒”字，但是实际上味道异常鲜美，并且完全无害。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32238_TextTitle"
msgid "毒蟾蜍"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32238_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32239_TextBody"
msgid ""
"这一带的河蟾蜍繁殖得特别快，\n"
"如果不定期驱除的话会不得了的。\n"
"现在正好是定期驱除河蟾蜍的时候。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32239_TextTitle"
msgid "杖蟾蜍"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32239_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32240_TextBody"
msgid ""
"我们要驱除的对象是河蟾蜍中繁殖能力最强的杖蟾蜍。\n"
"其他的品种可以不用管。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32240_TextTitle"
msgid "杖蟾蜍"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32240_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32241_TextBody"
msgid "来到拉诺西亚开垦新地的农夫们不小心带来了新的物种，这些杖蟾蜍在没有任何天敌的情况下变得越来越多，一定要抑制它们的过度繁殖！"
