msgid "巨蟾蜍"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32242_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32243_TextBody"
msgid ""
"真不愧是新鲜的毒蟾蜍腿肉！\n"
"用黄油细细煎过后，撒上太阳柠檬的话……\n"
"口水四溢啊。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32243_TextTitle"
msgid "毒蟾蜍"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32243_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32244_TextBody"
msgid "乘着干燥的北风，一群陷阱草从黑衣森林飘到了萨纳兰地区。在这没有天敌的新世界，陷阱草们开始疯狂地生长，甚至已经影响到了道路上的行人。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32244_TextTitle"
msgid "陷阱草"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32244_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32245_TextBody"
msgid ""
"在冥想的时候我听到了伟大的元灵的低语。现在森林中的虫类繁殖得越来越多，恐怕以虫类为食的陷阱草也会随之增多。陷阱草一旦增加对其他的生物也会造成不良影响。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32245_TextTitle"
msgid "陷阱草"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32245_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32246_TextBody"
msgid ""
"有一种叫做大洋妖红花的花型魔物\n"
"在这一带长得太茂盛了……很让人头疼。\n"
"不知道是不是它们根深蒂固了，怎么砍都会再出现。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32246_TextTitle"
msgid "妖红花"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32246_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32247_TextBody"
msgid ""
"“境树”是守护黑衣森林的神圣之树，但是最近境树附近妖红花的数量却在逐渐增加。这些妖花可能将自己的种子埋到的周围的树中，因此我们需要对该地区的树木进行彻底调查，来推测妖红花的繁殖情况。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32247_TextTitle"
msgid "妖红花"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32247_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32248_TextBody"
msgid "妖花的根部可以榨出令生物精神高扬的成分，不过这种成分对人类的刺激性过高，甚至一些动植物也承受不住。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32248_TextTitle"
msgid "陷阱草"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32248_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32249_TextBody"
msgid ""
"蝙蝠既不是鸟类也不是兽类。\n"
"所以常有人认为它是不伦不类的异类，\n"
"其实并不是那样。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32249_TextTitle"
msgid "蝙蝠"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32249_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32250_TextBody"
msgid ""
"吸血蝙蝠会以敏捷而华丽的动作干扰敌人。\n"
"想要给予它们还击可是件极为困难的事情。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32250_TextTitle"
msgid "蝙蝠"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32250_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32251_TextBody"
msgid ""
"栖息在森林地带的猴子。以首领奥猴为中心，由几十只奥猴组成集体过群居生活。用长长的尾巴和灵活的手掌在树木之间穿梭。原本的主食主要是水果，但近年爱吃豆子的奥猴越来越多，甚至会去糟蹋人类的田地。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32251_TextTitle"
msgid "奥猴"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32251_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32252_TextBody"
msgid ""
"食材是“姆恩·图伊豆”。虽然这些味道很冲的豆子\n"
"并不是奥猴特别喜欢吃的食物，\n"
"不过可能是因为它们饥不择食了，最近总是偷东西吃。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32252_TextTitle"
msgid "奥猴"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32252_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32253_TextBody"
msgid ""
"我本来想要将风车小屋里磨好的小麦粉发货的，\n"
"但那些饿疯了的婴猴总是会袭击过来，\n"
"我根本运不出去。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32253_TextTitle"
msgid "婴猴"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32253_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32254_TextBody"
msgid "天宫蟹原本是卢恩人放生回自然以保持长期食物来源的小蟹，不过不知不觉间它却已经成长得异常巨大，并且对任何进入领地的人都会发动攻击。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32254_TextTitle"
msgid "天宫蟹"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32254_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32255_TextBody"
msgid "蟹肉向来是一部分捕鱼人的最爱，不过最近出现的一只巨大魔蟹让人吃尽了苦头。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32255_TextTitle"
msgid "壳蟹"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32255_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32256_TextBody"
msgid "软木球茎经常将它们的根部深入到地下以摄取养分，可是最近这片地区的软木球茎数量太多了，它们在悬崖上对地层造成的破坏很容易引起塌方。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32256_TextTitle"
msgid "球茎"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32256_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32257_TextBody"
msgid "鹈鹕的肉向来又硬又难以咀嚼，除非一口吞掉。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32257_TextTitle"
msgid "鹈鹕"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32257_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32258_TextBody"
msgid ""
"你知道席兹类的魔物都是成对狩猎的吗？\n"
"其一负责发现并驱赶猎物，\n"
"其二则负责埋伏起来将猎物解决。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32258_TextTitle"
msgid "席兹"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32258_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32259_TextBody"
msgid "锤喙魔鸟的数量越来越多，它们已经开始准备扩张自己的领地了，放任不管的话会令野生的绵羊数量锐减。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32259_TextTitle"
msgid "魔鸟"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32259_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32260_TextBody"
msgid "迅猛龙中趾上的钩爪，质地坚硬而且异常锋利。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32260_TextTitle"
msgid "迅猛龙"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32260_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32261_TextBody"
msgid "将盗龙的腿肉与食用菌一起炖，魔女咖啡馆的招牌菜。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32261_TextTitle"
msgid "盗龙"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32261_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32262_TextBody"
msgid ""
"灵灾过后，变色龙的数量在不断猛增，\n"
"它们可能是为了寻找食物，所以才进入森林中的。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32262_TextTitle"
msgid "变色龙"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32262_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32263_TextBody"
msgid ""
"我们法师会经常到裸岩丘附近，\n"
"去和森林中的元灵对话。\n"
"而最近，却频繁遭到那些愈发残暴的变色龙的袭击。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32263_TextTitle"
msgid "变色龙"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32263_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32264_TextBody"
msgid ""
"变色龙剩下最后一只时会逃跑，\n"
"逃到指定地点就会出现其它变色龙。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32264_TextTitle"
msgid "变色龙"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32264_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32265_TextBody"
msgid ""
"“变色龙蛋”又大又有营养。\n"
"对于练兵所的士兵来说可是丰盛的慰问品。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32265_TextTitle"
msgid "变色龙"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32265_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32266_TextBody"
msgid "有传闻说哥布林族可以将变色龙作为家畜驱使。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32266_TextTitle"
msgid "变色龙"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32266_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32267_TextBody"
msgid ""
"我在森林劳作的时候，被森疾龙袭击了！\n"
"然后慌慌张张地逃到了这里……\n"
"但那些家伙太缠人了，还跟着我！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32267_TextTitle"
msgid "森疾龙"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32267_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32268_TextBody"
msgid "又到了红螳螂的繁殖期，大量的小红螳螂破卵而出，这会对周围的树林造成相当大的生态影响。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32268_TextTitle"
msgid "螳螂"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32268_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32269_TextBody"
msgid "螳螂杀手的卵中孵化出了大量的幼虫，如果放任它们自由成长的话恐怕拉诺西亚高地地区生态会遭到严重破坏。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32269_TextTitle"
msgid "螳螂"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32269_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32270_TextBody"
msgid ""
"南洋品种的羽毛色彩鲜艳的鸟类。为了吸食花蜜，长着形状独特的喙。对发光的物体感兴趣，还会将贝类等整个吞下去。此外，听说通过训练可以模仿人类说话。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32270_TextTitle"
msgid "蜂鸟"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32270_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32271_TextBody"
msgid "蜂鸟喜欢花蜜，而且特别喜欢旅神葵和接雨草这种红色花的花蜜。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32271_TextTitle"
msgid "蜂鸟"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32271_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32272_TextBody"
msgid ""
"太阳海岸附近活动着的蜂鸟，原本都是我饲养的。\n"
"从我身边逃走后，它们便成了这附近的野生动物。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32272_TextTitle"
msgid "蜂鸟"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32272_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32273_TextBody"
msgid "虹蝶贝经常被用来当做珠宝饰品的材料，但是蜂鸟们却对这类东西特别感兴趣，要是被它们吞下去会对很多以采集虹蝶贝为生的人造成很大损失。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32273_TextTitle"
msgid "蜂鸟"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32273_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32274_TextBody"
msgid ""
"一种四足肉食兽，其凶猛的模样让人畏惧。它们的触须十分灵活，捕猎时会用触须放出电击将猎物麻痹后进行捕食。原栖息地为近东地域。艾欧泽亚栖息的长须豹是那些用于战斗被引进而后回归野性的长须豹。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32274_TextTitle"
msgid "长须豹"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32274_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32275_TextBody"
msgid "长须豹的幼崽要长出这么长的胡须至少需要一整年，不过剪下这根胡须只需不到一分钟。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32275_TextTitle"
msgid "长须豹"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32275_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32276_TextBody"
msgid ""
"不过长须豹这种魔兽原本是外来物种。\n"
"经过我的调查，好像是有商人和海盗们勾结，\n"
"走私到威尔布兰德岛来的。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32276_TextTitle"
msgid "长须豹"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32276_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32277_TextBody"
msgid ""
"如小山一样的巨型两足兽。与头部的苔藓是共存关系，苔藓会给予古菩猩猩伪装，而在干燥期的时候，古菩猩猩会用长长的手臂给头部的苔藓浇水保湿。平时移动很缓慢，在饿了的时候会用那大大的嘴将会动的东西全部吃掉。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32277_TextTitle"
msgid "古菩猩猩"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32277_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32278_TextBody"
msgid "虽然绿巨猩猩的脸上总是带着微笑，可是实际上它却是十分凶暴的特异种生物。它在觅食期中会不分青红皂白吞掉一切生物，甚至包括人类。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32278_TextTitle"
msgid "绿巨猩猩"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32278_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32279_TextBody"
msgid "不管是肉还是植物，任何东西都能下肚的古菩猩猩，现在在葡萄酒港周围大闹一通。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32279_TextTitle"
msgid "古菩猩猩"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32279_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32280_TextBody"
msgid ""
"原产自马兹拉雅岛的大型鸟类，因为过于肥胖而失去了飞行的能力。当初一部分卢恩人将渡渡鸟的蛋带到了大陆上，后来一部分没有被吃掉的蛋孵化成功，从此不会飞的渡渡鸟成功跨越了大洋走进大陆。渡渡鸟的胸肉特别美味，现在在艾欧泽亚的各大城邦都有饲养。不过家养并不意味着没有危险，渡渡鸟口中的催眠分泌物特别强劲，在遭到攻击时会吐向对方以求自保。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32280_TextTitle"
msgid "渡渡鸟"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32280_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32281_TextBody"
msgid "这片土地曾经是一片宽广的小麦田，可惜在灵灾之后荒废了，现在已经完全被野生渡渡鸟占领了。要重新开垦这块耕地，一定要先把渡渡鸟的巢穴都给破坏掉！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32281_TextTitle"
msgid "渡渡鸟"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32281_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32282_TextBody"
msgid "暴食格特鲁德原本只是一只平凡的渡渡鸟，可是后来被牧童抛弃了，结果变成了一只野生的怪鸟。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32282_TextTitle"
msgid "渡渡鸟"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32282_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32283_TextBody"
msgid "雨燕塔殖民地从前便在饲养渡渡鸟。趁他们还在进行复兴，现在去支援，必能按我们开的价买下渡渡鸟肉。因此我想一边吃渡渡鸟肉做的菜一边谈生意。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32283_TextTitle"
msgid "渡渡鸟"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32283_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32284_TextBody"
msgid "曾经那片金色麦田覆盖的土地，现已成渡渡鸟们的巢窟了。为了改变这一现状，我准备把那些家伙的蛋当作食物拿出去卖，还能小赚一笔。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32284_TextTitle"
msgid "渡渡鸟"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32284_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32285_TextBody"
msgid "我们赤血雄鸡农场在渡渡鸟的饲养上花了不少心思。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32285_TextTitle"
msgid "渡渡鸟"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32285_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32286_TextBody"
msgid ""
"渡渡鸟的肉和所产的蛋都相当美味！\n"
"只要在幼鸟时期将会发出毒气的毒腺摘除后，\n"
"就可以放心饲养了。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32286_TextTitle"
msgid "渡渡鸟"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32286_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32287_TextBody"
msgid ""
"我们这么坚守这里都是为了保护这片土地的迁入者。\n"
"可现在却因为他们过去饲养过的渡渡鸟野生化，\n"
"而造成了这种问题……虽然鸟蛋倒是挺好吃的。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32287_TextTitle"
msgid "渡渡鸟"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32287_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32288_TextBody"
msgid ""
"从这个架台再往前走，\n"
"就是凶残的“席兹”和“死亡凝视”之类怪物的巢穴了。\n"
"不想被抓去吃掉的话还是绕开吧。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32288_TextTitle"
msgid "死亡凝视"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32288_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32289_TextBody"
msgid "“乌菊石”是种恶心的绿色魔物。我认为乌菊石是古人使用魔法使其巨大化后，形成的食用贝壳。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32289_TextTitle"
msgid "乌菊石"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32289_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32290_TextBody"
msgid "石绿湖的温泉一直是一个不错的疗养地，但是附近增多的乌菊石很有可能污染到温泉的水质。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32290_TextTitle"
msgid "乌菊石"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32290_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32291_TextBody"
msgid "火山的地热与石绿湖的清水，二者的共同效果就是催生出了一只独一无二的巨大古螺，这只生物对我们来说是个巨大的威胁。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32291_TextTitle"
msgid "佐菊石"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32291_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32292_TextBody"
msgid ""
"有一种叫河堤盲头蟹的魔物在中央林区的河边筑了巢。\n"
"它们是一群好战的魔物，有些捕鱼人也遭到了它们的袭击。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32292_TextTitle"
msgid "盲头蟹"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32292_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32293_TextBody"
msgid "一群盲头蟹为了扩张生息地从对岸跨过石绿湖来到了这里，如果让它们留下会对岸这边的生态造成不小的影响，快将这些盲头蟹赶走！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32293_TextTitle"
msgid "盲头蟹"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32293_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32294_TextBody"
msgid "跳蜥的膜状翅膀，在沙漠之民中被视为女孩的护身符。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32294_TextTitle"
msgid "跳蜥"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32294_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32295_TextBody"
msgid ""
"因为跳蜥会将搬运花粉的小蜜蜂吃得一干二净，\n"
"所以我们必须挨个进行人工受粉才行。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32295_TextTitle"
msgid "跳蜥"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32295_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32296_TextBody"
msgid "巨像兵心脏部位的石头，里面注有强力的魔法。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32296_TextTitle"
msgid "巨像兵"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32296_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32297_TextBody"
msgid ""
"在桤木泉南边的巨大建筑群里徘徊着巨像兵。\n"
"您在那附近探索的时候要特别小心。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32297_TextTitle"
msgid "巨像兵"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32297_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32298_TextBody"
msgid ""
"南萨纳兰有很多巨像兵，\n"
"据说它们是由贝拉哈迪亚的魔法师们\n"
"造来守护喀恩埋没圣堂的。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32298_TextTitle"
msgid "巨像兵"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32298_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32299_TextBody"
msgid ""
"“妖异十二阶”中排名第十一阶级的火球状气体生物。它们只要一见到体内含有油脂的生物，无论是动物植物还是人类，就会为了让油脂成为自身的燃料而无差别地发起攻击。而其中一类温度更高的爆弹怪被称作“榴弹怪”，可排进“妖异十二阶”的第十阶级。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32299_TextTitle"
msgid "爆弹怪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32299_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32300_TextBody"
msgid ""
"这种奇妙的魔物会四处爬行寻找能够形成自己甲壳的矿物。关于这种魔物有两种截然不同的解释：格里达尼亚的学者认为这是一种为了自保而在背上植入矿石的动物；乌尔达哈的学者则认为这是一种为了增殖而寄生并控制动物行动的矿石。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32300_TextTitle"
msgid "矿爬虫"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32300_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32301_TextBody"
msgid "知道从低纯度的矿石中提炼出有用金属的方法吗？那就是将吃得圆滚滚的矿爬虫丢进高热炉的最新精炼技术——矿爬虫精炼法。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32301_TextTitle"
msgid "矿爬虫"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32301_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32302_TextBody"
msgid ""
"潜藏在狱门蚁穴的银矿爬虫，\n"
"会在列车经过时跳上装货的车厢，\n"
"吞噬我们贵重的矿石……"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32302_TextTitle"
msgid "矿爬虫"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32302_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32303_TextBody"
msgid "矿妖虫以优质矿脉为食，可以说是采矿工们的最大敌人。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32303_TextTitle"
msgid "矿妖虫"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32303_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32304_TextBody"
msgid "青磷水是矿妖虫最喜欢的食物之一，它们经常成群结队地埋伏在运输路线上伺机袭击运输队伍。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32304_TextTitle"
msgid "矿妖虫"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32304_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32305_TextBody"
msgid "毒蟾魔菇的伞帽，五颜六色的。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32305_TextTitle"
msgid "魔菇"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32305_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32306_TextBody"
msgid "魔菇可以通过将孢子散布到树木上来进行繁殖，只需很短的时间就能长出大量的新魔菇，这样一来树木会损失很多养分。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32306_TextTitle"
msgid "魔菇"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32306_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32307_TextBody"
msgid ""
"有俗语说“多雷的年份蘑菇旺”……\n"
"灵灾后不断增殖的毒蟾魔菇和雷元精之间的因果关系，\n"
"就让我来证明给你们看！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32307_TextTitle"
msgid "魔菇"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32307_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32308_TextBody"
msgid ""
"……果然，有很多毒蟾魔菇的残骸！\n"
"灵灾后套索花的数量激增，\n"
"原因果然在于毒蟾魔菇啊！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32308_TextTitle"
msgid "魔菇"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32308_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32309_TextBody"
msgid ""
"套索花摄食毒蟾魔菇，在体内产生有毒气体……\n"
"再以这个为武器来捕食猎物。\n"
"这正是食物链！必须得赶快写稿子了……"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32309_TextTitle"
msgid "魔菇"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32309_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32310_TextBody"
msgid ""
"你知道栖息在城外的一种\n"
"叫做“丛林魔菇”的魔物吗？"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32310_TextTitle"
msgid "魔菇"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32310_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32311_TextBody"
msgid ""
"大量的孢子依附在了附近的植物上，\n"
"妨碍了森林中树木的生长……\n"
"因此我们决定铲除掉一些丛林魔菇。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32311_TextTitle"
msgid "魔菇"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32311_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32312_TextBody"
msgid "由于花甲虫繁殖速度过快，不仅是害虫，就连益虫也被它们疯狂地吃掉了。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32312_TextTitle"
msgid "花甲虫"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32312_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32313_TextBody"
msgid "花甲虫是一种能够吃掉农场内害虫的益虫，所以务农的人都很欢迎它们到自己的地里生活。但是最近却出现了一种新的疾病在花甲虫之间互相传染。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32313_TextTitle"
msgid "花甲虫"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32313_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32314_TextBody"
msgid ""
"你在探索杂草丛时一定要小心。\n"
"花甲虫最喜欢吃蚜虫了……\n"
"你在捉蚜虫的时候可能会被它们袭击。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32314_TextTitle"
msgid "花甲虫"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32314_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32315_TextBody"
msgid ""
"花甲虫会捕食蚜虫。\n"
"所以为了驱赶那些啃噬作物的蚜虫，\n"
"利用它们天敌的气味是最有效的方法！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32315_TextTitle"
msgid "花甲虫"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32315_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32316_TextBody"
msgid ""
"最近，或许是天气的缘故，\n"
"西萨纳兰附近出现了大量名为花甲虫的魔物。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32316_TextTitle"
msgid "花甲虫"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_loading_content_cfg,32316_TextLabel"
msgid "怪物"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1001_QuestName"
msgid "制作委托：双蛇党用于训练的长枪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1001_QuestDesc"
msgid ""
"最近我们收到了双蛇党发来的订单，要订购一批用于新兵训练的长枪。双蛇党是我们重要的顾客，交货上绝对不能有半分耽搁。所以希望能有做事牢靠的工匠来参与制作。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1001_CityNPCTitle"
msgid "黑兔堂采购部长"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1002_QuestName"
msgid "制作委托：新手卫兵用的木盾"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1002_QuestDesc"
msgid ""
"我们鬼哭队有一批新兵结束了训练成功被选拔为重步兵。为了向他们表达出色完成训练的祝贺，同时也希望他们能够成为守护故乡的铁壁，我们准备向他们赠送一批木盾。希望接下这个委托的工匠能够做出具有纪念意义的佳品。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1002_CityNPCTitle"
msgid "鬼哭队第一枪队辎重兵"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1003_QuestName"
msgid "制作委托：双蛇党用于训练的长弓"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1003_QuestDesc"
msgid ""
"最近我们收到了双蛇党发来的订单，要订购一批用于新兵训练的长弓。双蛇党是我们重要的顾客，交货上绝对不能有半分耽搁。所以希望能有做事牢靠的工匠来参与制作。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1003_CityNPCTitle"
msgid "黑兔堂采购部长"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1004_QuestName"
msgid "制作委托：新手卫生兵用的幻具"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1004_QuestDesc"
msgid ""
"我们鬼哭队有一批新兵结束了训练成功被选拔为卫生兵。为了向他们表达出色完成训练的祝贺，同时也希望他们能够救助战友们的生命，我们准备向他们赠送一批幻具。希望接下这个委托的工匠能够做出具有纪念意义的佳品。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1004_CityNPCTitle"
msgid "鬼哭队第一枪队辎重兵"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1005_QuestName"
msgid "筹集委托：面向雕金匠的制作工具"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1005_QuestDesc"
msgid ""
"随着来自乌尔达哈的商人也在黑檀商店街搭起了店铺，其中的一些雕金匠向我们黑兔堂下了制作工具的订单。这无论对于黑兔堂还是对于格里达尼亚来说都是绝佳的商机，而且也能表达出对乌尔达哈的友好。希望能有技术娴熟的工匠来协助我们。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1005_CityNPCTitle"
msgid "黑兔堂采购部长"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1006_QuestName"
msgid "筹集委托：牧场用的裁缝工具"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1006_QuestDesc"
msgid ""
"对于饲育陆行鸟这个职业而言，衣服和物品出现开线和磨损的情况简直是家常便饭了。每次找专业人员来修补这些用品也是一笔不小的开支。所以我们目前想要尽量凭借自己的力量来解决，希望能够有人提供给我们裁缝用的相应工具。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1006_CityNPCTitle"
msgid "莫古力礼峰牧童"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1007_QuestName"
msgid "制作委托：铁制长枪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1007_QuestDesc"
msgid ""
"鬼哭队的新兵居然做出了将物资低价转卖给乌尔达哈的商人这种事，这在以前是难以想象的。虽然我们已经给与了犯人开除的处分，但是被卖掉的物资这一空缺也无法追回了。为了补充物资的库存，希望有实力的工匠能够前来协助。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1007_CityNPCTitle"
msgid "黑兔堂采购部长"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1008_QuestName"
msgid "制作委托：榆木制幻具"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1008_QuestDesc"
msgid "为了对应今后的需求扩大，我们需要增加榆木制双手幻杖的库存量。希望有实力的工匠能够前来应聘。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1008_CityNPCTitle"
msgid "黑兔堂采购部长"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1009_QuestName"
msgid "筹集委托：打磨武具用的砂轮"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1009_QuestDesc"
msgid "我等鬼哭队正在筹备砂轮以打磨枪尖与箭头。为了在鸟人族的威胁下守护石场水车，打磨完毕的武具是不可或缺的。我们诚心恭候技术娴熟的工匠前来协助。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1009_CityNPCTitle"
msgid "鬼哭队第五枪队队员"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1010_QuestName"
msgid "制作委托：面向义勇兵的长枪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1010_QuestDesc"
msgid ""
"我等鬼哭队第五枪队正在为迎击鸟人族来袭进行筹备，需要向辅城的年轻枪手们发配一批长枪。现招募能够制作出符合他们义勇兵身份的武器的工匠师傅。请有心人务必前来帮忙。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1010_CityNPCTitle"
msgid "鬼哭队第五枪队队员"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1011_QuestName"
msgid "制作委托：面向义勇兵的幻具"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1011_QuestDesc"
msgid ""
"近日辅城的情况越来越严峻，随时都有可能受到鸟人族的进攻。为此我们请来了幻术师行会的法师向义勇兵们传授基础的幻术魔法，以备不时之需。现急需招募对制作幻具有自信的工匠师傅协助我们制作一批幻具，用来给义勇兵们训练用。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1011_CityNPCTitle"
msgid "鬼哭队第五枪队队员"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1012_QuestName"
msgid "制作委托：提供给鬼哭队的长枪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1012_QuestDesc"
msgid "守卫辅城是我等鬼哭队第五枪队的使命。经历了多次战斗，有不少武器都磨损了，我们需要新的武器。衷心希望有能力制作长枪的工匠来协助我们。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1012_CityNPCTitle"
msgid "鬼哭队第五枪队队员"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1013_QuestName"
msgid "筹集委托：送礼用的钓竿"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1013_QuestDesc"
msgid "我的主人格格鲁玖贩卖古今东西的珍品，以此发家致富。因此，他对稀有的钓具十分着迷。希望有能力制作古色古香的钓具的工匠来协助我们。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1013_CityNPCTitle"
msgid "格格鲁玖商会管理员"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1014_QuestName"
msgid "制作委托：捐赠给黑涡团的幻杖"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_levequest_cfg,1014_QuestDesc"
