msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,58999200_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"再往前就是“神勇队”的司令部，那是保护森林不受外敌侵犯的巡逻队。\n"
"弓箭手行会也设在那里。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,58999201_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,58999202_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,58999300_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"虽然击退山贼的报酬也不少，\n"
"可毕竟还是想要做一些帅气潇洒的工作啊。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,58999301_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,58999302_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,58999400_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"格里达尼亚的饭菜看上去就很普通，味道也很淡。\n"
"怎么说呢，感觉吃了就跟没吃一样。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,58999401_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,58999402_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,58999500_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"你可不要太贪心啊……吧唧吧唧……\n"
"这是我……爷爷说的……吧唧吧唧……"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,58999501_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,58999502_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,58999600_DialogContent"
msgid "我只要……有酒喝就行……"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,58999601_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,58999602_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,58999700_DialogContent"
msgid "抱歉，我们还没有开始营业。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,58999701_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,58999702_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

