msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59011400_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"冒险者么。\n"
"你摸过弯枝牧场的以太之光了么？\n"
"想在这附近转，可不能忘了摸以太之光啊。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59011401_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59011402_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59011500_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"这里是弯枝牧场。\n"
"千万别刺激牧场里的陆行鸟。"
msgstr ""

