"真拿你没辙……我就陪你玩玩吧！！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59210701_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59210702_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59210800_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"嗯，你想和我用九宫幻卡一决胜负？\n"
"大爷我可是霉运神大奖赛的冠军！\n"
"平时可忙了，哪有时间陪你玩！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59210801_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59210802_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59210900_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"哈！果然大爷我就是天下第一！\n"
"别在意别在意，输了也没必要那么失落嘛。\n"
"大爷我毕竟是霉运神大奖赛的冠军，厉害得很啊！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59210901_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59210902_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211000_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"……啥？\n"
"赢得霉运神大奖赛的大爷我……竟然输了……\n"
"一、一定是我给你放太多水了！这次不算！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211001_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211002_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211100_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"哼……就让你得意一会吧。\n"
"和赢得了霉运神大奖赛的大爷我交手，\n"
"竟然还能不分胜负……你这家伙运气不错！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211101_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211102_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211200_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"噢，要跟我来一局啊？\n"
"我可喜欢玩卡牌了。\n"
"来吧，我是不会手下留情的！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211201_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211202_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211300_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"不好意思，我现在工作有点忙。\n"
"你也有很多事要去做吧？\n"
"等我们下次都有空的时候再来吧。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211301_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211302_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211400_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"我赢了啊！\n"
"<player>，你还需要多多练习呀。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211401_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211402_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211500_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"哎哟，好不甘心……\n"
"这样的话，只能缩短锻铁的工作时间，\n"
"多花一些功夫来思考幻卡的作战策略了……咳咳！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211501_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211502_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211600_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"竟然跟使出全力的我不分胜负！\n"
"<player>，你还挺能折腾！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211601_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211602_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211700_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"你要向我挑战九宫幻卡？\n"
"<player>，你胆子不小啊！\n"
"你会因为你的愚蠢行为感到后悔的！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211701_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211702_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211800_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"卡牌先别玩了，你的本职工作是冒险者啊。\n"
"踏上旅途，去不熟悉的地方冒险一番怎么样？\n"
"我会一直在这里等着你回来！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211801_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211802_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211900_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"哎呀，我赢了我赢了！\n"
"我说，你也别这么失落啊。\n"
"胜负有时候还得看运气！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211901_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59211902_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212000_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"<player>，干得漂亮啊！\n"
"是不是就没有什么你不擅长的事呢。\n"
"我可不要什么都输给你啊！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212001_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212002_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212100_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"我对自己九宫幻卡的实力还是很有自信的……\n"
"没想到你竟然这么强！\n"
"不过下次我一定会赢的。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212101_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212102_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212200_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"哦？想要邀请我一起来一局九宫幻卡？\n"
"那么就麻烦你赐教了！\n"
"请与我一决胜负吧！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212201_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212202_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212300_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"谢谢你的邀请。不过现在我正在执勤。\n"
"如果下次你在冒险时还能抽空来找我的话，\n"
"就请你那时再邀请我吧！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212301_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212302_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212400_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"我、我我我赢了啊！\n"
"没想到我竟然也能赢……\n"
"真是感慨万千！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212401_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212402_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212500_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"真不愧是冒险者阁下！\n"
"看来我必须得更加努力地提升自己。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212501_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212502_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212600_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"原来如此，竟然还有这样的战术！\n"
"真是受教了！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212601_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212602_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212700_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"我要开动脑筋，让头皮迸发生机……\n"
"啊，快醒醒吧，我的发根！\n"
"一切为了生发！！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212701_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212702_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212800_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"……想跟我用九宫幻卡一决胜负？\n"
"不好意思，现在我不太想动脑子。\n"
"现在头皮凉凉的，没动力思考……"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212801_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212802_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212900_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"灼热的太阳，还有我心爱的发根啊……\n"
"感谢你们赐予我胜利的奖赏，非常感谢——"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212901_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59212902_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213000_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"不管是我的心，还是我心爱的发根……\n"
"全都燃烧殆尽……化为尘埃……"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213001_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213002_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213100_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"嗯，本来我觉得你的战术还是很不错的。\n"
"但是坏就坏在第二张和第三张卡片的顺序……不对，是位置……\n"
"够了，不想思考了！对头皮健康无益！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213101_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213102_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213200_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"在执行调查任务时，娱乐活动实在很少啊……\n"
"你要是能陪我玩一会的话，我会很感激你的。\n"
"来吧，让我们轻松一下！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213201_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213202_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213300_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213301_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213302_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213400_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"是因为手冻僵了把卡片都出错了吗？\n"
"要是你还想找我挑战，我随时都可以奉陪。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213401_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213402_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213500_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"唉，输了啊。\n"
"……嘿嘿嘿，不错，我都热血沸腾了。\n"
"以后要再来找我玩啊。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213501_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213502_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213600_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"这结果真是让人不痛快啊……\n"
"你以后有空的话就再来找我吧。\n"
"下次我一定会赢你的。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213601_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213602_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213700_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"你敢来挑战我红心天王，\n"
"说明你对自己的实力很有自信啊？\n"
"嘿嘿，让我们来痛快地比一场吧！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213701_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213702_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213800_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213801_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213802_DialogContent"
msgid "<blank>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_default_dialog_cfg,59213900_DialogContent"
msgid ""
"虽然你很努力了，但水平还差得远呢！\n"
"强大的卡片和灵活的战术……\n"
"这两点中但凡缺了任何一点，你都赢不了我！"
