"效果：令<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">紧张感</>增加，至少增加12，至多增加18。有25%概率获得<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【内静】</>状态。\n"
"<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【内静】</>：<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">雕刻</>和<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">琢磨</>效率提高20%，持续3个工次。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30504_SkillName"
msgid "集中"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30505_Desc"
msgid "效果：令<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">紧张感</>随机调整到15或者85。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30505_SkillName"
msgid "即兴发挥"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30506_Desc"
msgid ""
"效果：将绿区和蓝区变为紫色区域（获得两种加成）。在紫区内，使用<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">雕刻</>时，额外获得总效率75%的<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">品质</>；使用<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">琢磨</>时，额外获取总效率75%的<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">进展</>。\n"
"使用条件：<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">紧张感</>处于绿色或蓝色区域"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30506_SkillName"
msgid "眼力"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30507_Desc"
msgid ""
"效果：获得<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【阔步】</>。\n"
"<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【阔步】</>：使下1次施放的<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">雕刻</>和<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">琢磨</>效果提高40%。若当前<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">紧张感</>在特殊区域（绿，蓝，紫）则改为下3次。至多持续8个工次。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30507_SkillName"
msgid "阔步"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30508_Desc"
msgid ""
"效果：获得<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【极致】</>。\n"
"<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【极致】</>：连续使用<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">琢磨</>或<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">雕刻</>时（包括获得<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【极致】</>前的1个工次），对应的<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">进展/品质</>效率会提升。在持续时间内使用任意2次<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">琢磨</>或<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">雕刻</>后状态消失。第1次提升70%，第2次提升220%。至多持续4工次。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30508_SkillName"
msgid "极致"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30509_Desc"
msgid ""
"效果：获得<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【平衡】</>。\n"
"<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【平衡】</>：交替使用<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">琢磨</>或<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">雕刻</>时（包括获得<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【平衡】</>前的1个工次），对应的<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">进展/品质</>效率会提升160%。在持续时间内使用任意2次<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">琢磨</>或<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">雕刻</>后状态消失，至多持续4工次。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30509_SkillName"
msgid "平衡"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30510_Desc"
msgid ""
"效果：提高<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">进展</>。\n"
"基础效率：50"
msgstr ""

