msgid "升温"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30603_Desc"
msgid "效果：使4个部位的<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>各自提升6至18。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30603_SkillName"
msgid "旋转"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30604_Desc"
msgid ""
"效果：获得<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【力量控制】</>来强化<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">大力捶打</>。\n"
"<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【力量控制】</>：若选择<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>最高的部位发动<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">大力捶打</>，则<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">效率</>额外提升80。若选择<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>最低的部位发动<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">大力捶打</>，则会额外提升<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>，此状态持续工次越少，<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>提升量越少，至少提升10。持续3个工次。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30604_SkillName"
msgid "力量控制"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30605_Desc"
msgid ""
"效果：使4个部位的<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>在小范围（±5）内随机变化，但他们<span "
"color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>的总和尽可能不变。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30605_SkillName"
msgid "修整"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30606_Desc"
msgid ""
"效果：所有部位的<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>降低20%，回复10<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">耐久</>。\n"
"使用条件：4个部位的<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>均达到35或以上"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30606_SkillName"
msgid "冷却"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30607_Desc"
msgid ""
"效果：对4个部位同时按照当前<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>发动<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">大力捶打</>，且基础效率变为120。<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热锻</>发动的<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">大力捶打</>只会令捶打部位自身的<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>上升，但上升量也会有所提高。\n"
"每次制作过程中此技能最多可以使用3次。3次使用条件分别为：\n"
"第一次使用条件：4个部位的<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>均达到35或以上\n"
"第二次使用条件：4个部位的<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>均达到70或以上\n"
"第三次使用条件：4个部位的<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>均达到90或以上"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30607_SkillName"
msgid "热锻"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30608_Desc"
msgid ""
"效果：自动敲打一次当前<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>最高的部位，提升<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">进展</>。捶打不会使<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>产生变化。\n"
"基础效率：100"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30608_SkillName"
msgid "敲打"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30609_Desc"
msgid ""
"在<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【技巧掌控】</>或者<span "
"color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【力量控制】</>状态下，使用<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">技巧捶打</>或者<span "
"color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">大力捶打</>技能有35%的概率不消耗<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">耐久</>和<span"
" color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">制作力。</>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30609_SkillName"
msgid "乐观"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30610_Desc"
msgid ""
"<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">升温</>将有50%概率选中<span "
"color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>最高的部位。<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">旋转</>可使<span "
"color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>最低部位的提升量变为12至18。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30610_SkillName"
msgid "果敢"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30611_Desc"
msgid ""
"使用<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">冷却</>技能后可获得<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【强化冷却】</>。\n"
"<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【强化冷却】：</>下一次<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">大力捶打</>、<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">技巧捶打</>或<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">敲打</>将有50%概率暴击，获得双倍的<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">制作效率</>以及选择部位<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>提升量（相邻部位的<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>提升量不受影响）。至多持续3个工次。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30611_SkillName"
msgid "强化冷却"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30612_Desc"
msgid ""
"锻铁匠通过敲打作业台的不同部位来完成作业。对部位施放<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">敲打</>，<span "
"color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">大力捶打</>，<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">技巧捶打</>等技能时会增加部位的<span"
" color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>，<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>越高，这些技能的<span "
"color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">效率</>也越高。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30612_SkillName"
msgid "热度"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30613_Desc"
msgid ""
"效果：获得<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【技巧掌控】</>来强化<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">技巧捶打</>，同时令自身获得<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【技巧】</>。<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【技巧】</>会令<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【大力捶打】</>替换为<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【技巧捶打】</>。\n"
"<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【技巧掌控】</>：若选择<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>最低（0除外）的部位发动<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">技巧捶打</>，则<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>额外上升30。若选择<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>最高（0除外）的部位发动<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">技巧捶打</>，则会提升<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">效率</>，此状态持续工次越少，<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">效率</>提升量越大，最大60。持续3个工次。"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30613_SkillName"
msgid "技巧掌控"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30614_Desc"
msgid ""
"效果：使自身获得<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【技巧】</>，再次使用技能可以移除<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【技巧】</>。使用这个技能不会增加工次。\n"
"<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【技巧】</>：将<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">大力捶打</>转化为需要<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">额外消耗10制作力</>的<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">技巧捶打</>。<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">技巧捶打</>发动时，相邻部位的<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>上升量会低于<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">大力捶打</>，同时根据捶打部位<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>数字触发额外效果——\n"
"若捶打部位<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>为<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">3的倍数</>（0除外），触发<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热血</>：本次<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">技巧捶打</>的部位<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>上升值为<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">2.5</>倍，但相邻部位的<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>不变。\n"
"若捶打部位<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>为<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">5的倍数</>（0除外），触发<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">神眼</>：本次<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">技巧捶打</>的<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">效率</>变为<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">2</>倍，且令对角线部位的<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">热度</>增加1。\n"
"<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">技巧捶打</>基础效率：100"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30614_SkillName"
msgid "技巧捶打"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "c_skill_main_cfg,30615_Desc"
msgid ""
"效果：使自身获得<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【技巧】</>，再次使用技能可以移除<span color=\"#D1BA8EFF\">【技巧】</>。使用这个技能不会增加工次。\n"
